          "short_first_native_line": "披露的《浙江正裕工业股份有限公司向特定对象发行股票结果暨股本变动公告》"
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 3,
          "native_characters": 614,
          "native_text_sha256": "d4ed664e5b9958236e66f3d3f2f1b5404a53721a9fcbf5ecd8ebda5c1b0564f9",
          "short_first_native_line": "综上所述，保荐人对公司本次向特定对象发行股票限售股上市流通事项无异"
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 4,
          "native_characters": 647,
          "native_text_sha256": "d382c568981c5bb57c296a4f78a357948cab9bc9620bdc27507eacf027c613c3",
          "short_first_native_line": "绍兴上虞舜越控股有限"
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 5,
          "native_characters": 34,
          "native_text_sha256": "1880844334186e81afd22c35606688667328fa52b1db28a650ac4b553e780302",
          "short_first_native_line": "特此公告。"
        }
      ],
      "short_locator_hints": [
        {
          "physical_page": 1,
          "page_text_offset": 219,
          "snippet": " 本次股票上市流通日期为2026 年 9 月 21 日。",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 1,
          "page_text_offset": 496,
          "snippet": "发行新增股份为有限售条件流通股，将于 6 个月限售期满后的次一交易日在上海",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 53,
          "snippet": "本次限售股上市流通日期为2026 年9月21 日。",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 102,
          "snippet": "本次发行完成后，公司总股本由240,033,268 股增至275,719,231 股。",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 198,
          "snippet": "三、本次限售股上市流通的有关承诺",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 215,
          "snippet": "本次上市流通的限售股属于向特定对象发行股份，认购对象均承诺认购所获",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 271,
          "snippet": "除上述承诺外，本次申请上市流通的限售股股东无其他特别承诺。截至本公",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 305,
          "snippet": "告披露日，本次申请上市流通的限售股股东均严格履行了上述承诺，不存在相关",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 341,
          "snippet": "承诺未履行影响本次限售股上市流通的情况。",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 428,
          "snippet": "公司向特定对象发行股票中做出的各项承诺；公司本次限售股份上市流通数量、",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 464,
          "snippet": "上市流通时间均符合《证券发行上市保荐业务管理办法》《上海证券交易所股票",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 3,
          "page_text_offset": 80,
          "snippet": "（二）本次上市流通日期为2026 年9月21 日",
          "field_role_verified": false
        }
      ],
